      "source_pages":[2,3],
      "article":"Art. 5º, I",
      "rule":"Lists categories of delegates natos, including SME leadership, municipal school directors, ADEs, CME titular members, organizing commission, three representatives of each listed worker entity, Education Commission councillors, SME department directors, CACS-FUNDEB, CAE, FME and state-network supervisors."
